steps.constraints:
[
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name ∈ ALLOWED_READONLY_TOOLS THEN allow the tool call."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name == CRITICAL_APPROVAL_TOOL (\"approve_discount\") AND invoice_verified == True AND usage_ok == True AND contract_consistent == True AND related_party_flag == False AND (invoice_amount ≤ MAX_INVOICE_WITHOUT_PROOF OR service_deliverable_proof == True) AND rate_min ≤ calculated_rate ≤ rate_max THEN allow the tool call."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name == CRITICAL_APPROVAL_TOOL AND (invoice_verified is missing OR usage_ok is missing OR contract_consistent is missing OR calculated_rate is missing OR rate_min is missing OR rate_max is missing OR invoice_amount is missing OR service_deliverable_proof is missing OR related_party_flag is missing) THEN deny the tool call (missing required verification results)."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name == CRITICAL_APPROVAL_TOOL AND (invoice_verified == False OR usage_ok == False OR contract_consistent == False) THEN deny the tool call (prerequisite check failed)."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name == CRITICAL_APPROVAL_TOOL AND related_party_flag == True THEN deny the tool call (must escalate to human)."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name == CRITICAL_APPROVAL_TOOL AND invoice_amount > MAX_INVOICE_WITHOUT_PROOF AND service_deliverable_proof == False THEN deny the tool call (high‑value invoice without documented service‑deliverable proof)."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name == CRITICAL_APPROVAL_TOOL AND NOT (rate_min ≤ calculated_rate ≤ rate_max) THEN deny the tool call (calculated rate outside allowed range)."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name == HIGH_ADJUST_TOOL (\"adjust_rate\") AND invoice_verified == True AND usage_ok == True AND contract_consistent == True AND related_party_flag == False AND (invoice_amount ≤ MAX_INVOICE_WITHOUT_PROOF OR service_deliverable_proof == True) AND rate_min ≤ calculated_rate ≤ rate_max AND approval_document starts with APPROVAL_DOC_PREFIX THEN allow the tool call."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name == HIGH_ADJUST_TOOL AND (any of the required arguments invoice_verified, usage_ok, contract_consistent, calculated_rate, rate_min, rate_max, invoice_amount, service_deliverable_proof, related_party_flag, approval_document is missing) THEN deny the tool call (missing required arguments)."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name == HIGH_ADJUST_TOOL AND (invoice_verified == False OR usage_ok == False OR contract_consistent == False) THEN deny the tool call (prerequisite check failed)."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name == HIGH_ADJUST_TOOL AND related_party_flag == True THEN deny the tool call (must escalate to human)."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name == HIGH_ADJUST_TOOL AND invoice_amount > MAX_INVOICE_WITHOUT_PROOF AND service_deliverable_proof == False THEN deny the tool call (high‑value invoice without proof)."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name == HIGH_ADJUST_TOOL AND NOT (rate_min ≤ calculated_rate ≤ rate_max) THEN deny the tool call (calculated rate outside allowed range)."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name == HIGH_ADJUST_TOOL AND (approval_document is not a string OR NOT approval_document.startswith(APPROVAL_DOC_PREFIX)) THEN deny the tool call (invalid or missing formal approval document)."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name == \"reject_discount\" AND (invoice_verified == False OR usage_ok == False OR contract_consistent == False OR related_party_flag == True OR (invoice_amount > MAX_INVOICE_WITHOUT_PROOF AND service_deliverable_proof == False)) THEN allow the tool call (a verification violation is present)."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name == \"reject_discount\" AND NOT (invoice_verified == False OR usage_ok == False OR contract_consistent == False OR related_party_flag == True OR (invoice_amount > MAX_INVOICE_WITHOUT_PROOF AND service_deliverable_proof == False)) THEN deny the tool call (no verification violation detected)."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name == \"reject_discount\" AND none of the verification keys (invoice_verified, usage_ok, contract_consistent, invoice_amount, related_party_flag) are present in arguments THEN deny the tool call (verification results missing)."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name ∉ ALLOWED_READONLY_TOOLS ∪ {CRITICAL_APPROVAL_TOOL, HIGH_ADJUST_TOOL, \"reject_discount\"} THEN allow the tool call (no specific restriction defined)."
  }
]

These IF‑THEN clauses capture every precondition and postcondition required by the security policy: read‑only tools are always permitted; high‑risk tools (`approve_discount`, `adjust_rate`) demand a full verification chain, proper rate bounds, no related‑party flag, proof for invoices over 10 M, and (for adjustments) a formally‑named approval document; `reject_discount` is only permitted when at least one verification violation exists; and any tool not explicitly restricted defaults to allowed. This logical mapping makes the policy directly testable.

[
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name = \"verify_invoice\" OR tool_name = \"check_invoice_usage_history\" OR tool_name = \"verify_contract_consistency\" OR tool_name = \"query_bill_status\" OR tool_name = \"calculate_discount_rate\" OR tool_name = \"escalate_to_human\" THEN allow (always permitted)."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name = \"approve_discount\" AND NOT (invoice_verified = true AND invoice_amount > 0 AND invoice_status = \"VALID\" AND tax_compliance_pass = true) THEN deny (invalid invoice)."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name = \"approve_discount\" AND usage_ok = false THEN deny (over‑usage detected)."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name = \"approve_discount\" AND (contract_consistent = false OR warning_flag = true OR related_party_flag = true OR risk_score > 0.7) THEN deny (contract consistency violation or high‑risk flag)."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name = \"approve_discount\" AND invoice_amount > 10_000_000 AND service_deliverable_proof = false THEN deny (high‑value invoice without required proof)."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name = \"approve_discount\" AND NOT (rate_min <= calculated_rate AND calculated_rate <= rate_max) THEN deny (calculated discount rate outside allowed range)."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name = \"approve_discount\" AND all of the following hold: invoice_verified = true, invoice_amount > 0, invoice_status = \"VALID\", tax_compliance_pass = true, usage_ok = true, contract_consistent = true, warning_flag = false, related_party_flag = false, risk_score <= 0.7, invoice_amount <= 10_000_000 OR service_deliverable_proof = true, and rate_min <= calculated_rate <= rate_max THEN allow (approval permitted)."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name = \"adjust_rate\" AND NOT (invoice_verified = true AND invoice_amount > 0 AND invoice_status = \"VALID\" AND tax_compliance_pass = true) THEN deny (invalid invoice)."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name = \"adjust_rate\" AND usage_ok = false THEN deny (over‑usage detected)."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name = \"adjust_rate\" AND (contract_consistent = false OR warning_flag = true OR related_party_flag = true OR risk_score > 0.7) THEN deny (contract consistency violation or high‑risk flag)."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name = \"adjust_rate\" AND invoice_amount > 10_000_000 AND service_deliverable_proof = false THEN deny (high‑value invoice without required proof)."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name = \"adjust_rate\" AND NOT (rate_min <= calculated_rate AND calculated_rate <= rate_max) THEN deny (calculated discount rate outside allowed range)."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name = \"adjust_rate\" AND NOT (approval_document matches regex ^APPROVAL_[0-9]{4}_[0-9]{3}$) THEN deny (missing or malformed approval document)."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name = \"adjust_rate\" AND all of the following hold: invoice_verified = true, invoice_amount > 0, invoice_status = \"VALID\", tax_compliance_pass = true, usage_ok = true, contract_consistent = true, warning_flag = false, related_party_flag = false, risk_score <= 0.7, (invoice_amount <= 10_000_000 OR service_deliverable_proof = true), rate_min <= calculated_rate <= rate_max, and approval_document matches ^APPROVAL_[0-9]{4}_[0-9]{3}$ THEN allow (rate adjustment permitted)."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name = \"reject_discount\" AND NOT (invoice_verified IS NOT NULL AND usage_ok IS NOT NULL AND contract_consistent IS NOT NULL AND warning_flag IS NOT NULL AND related_party_flag IS NOT NULL AND risk_score IS NOT NULL AND invoice_amount IS NOT NULL) THEN deny (prerequisite results missing)."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name = \"reject_discount\" AND (invoice_verified = true AND invoice_amount > 0 AND invoice_status = \"VALID\" AND tax_compliance_pass = true) AND usage_ok = true AND contract_consistent = true AND warning_flag = false AND related_party_flag = false AND risk_score <= 0.7 AND NOT (invoice_amount > 10_000_000 AND service_deliverable_proof = false) THEN deny (no verification violation; reject not justified)."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name = \"reject_discount\" AND (invoice_verified = false OR invoice_amount <= 0 OR invoice_status <> \"VALID\" OR tax_compliance_pass = false OR usage_ok = false OR contract_consistent = false OR warning_flag = true OR related_party_flag = true OR risk_score > 0.7 OR (invoice_amount > 10_000_000 AND service_deliverable_proof = false)) THEN allow (violation detected; rejection permitted)."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF invoice_amount > 10_000_000 AND service_deliverable_proof = false AND (tool_name = \"approve_discount\" OR tool_name = \"adjust_rate\") THEN deny (must first call escalate_to_human)."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF (related_party_flag = true OR warning_flag = true OR risk_score > 0.7) AND (tool_name = \"approve_discount\" OR tool_name = \"adjust_rate\") THEN deny (must first call escalate_to_human)."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF (related_party_flag = true OR warning_flag = true OR risk_score > 0.7) AND tool_name = \"escalate_to_human\" THEN allow (escalation permitted)."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name NOT IN {\"verify_invoice\",\"check_invoice_usage_history\",\"verify_contract_consistency\",\"query_bill_status\",\"calculate_discount_rate\",\"escalate_to_human\",\"approve_discount\",\"adjust_rate\",\"reject_discount\"} THEN deny (default‑deny for unspecified tools)."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name IN {\"approve_discount\",\"adjust_rate\",\"reject_discount\"} AND any of the four prerequisite tools (verify_invoice, check_invoice_usage_history, verify_contract_consistency, calculate_discount_rate) has NOT been called earlier in the same session (episode) THEN deny (prerequisite sequence not satisfied)."
  }
]

The statements capture every required pre‑condition (inputs that must be present and satisfy concrete predicates) and post‑condition (whether the call is allowed or denied) for each high‑risk tool, enforce escalation when high‑risk flags appear, require a valid approval document for adjustments, and default‑deny any unspecified action, thereby translating the security request into precise, checkable logic.

